{
 "facts": [
  "On October 1, 2023, Andrew said that he and his girlfriend planned to go to the beach with Toby in November 2023.",
  "On June 26, 2023, Audrey said Audrey had moved into a new place with a bigger backyard for Audrey’s two dogs. The dogs enjoyed running around and exploring the backyard.",
  "Audrey has a tattoo of her four dogs and recently added more drawings to the tattoo. Audrey said the tattoo was enough for now, but might get another tattoo if she gets another dog someday.",
  "On 11 July 2023, Audrey said she had made personalized tags for her pets herself. The tags were wooden keychains engraved with names, and Audrey said she wanted each tag to suit the pet’s personality and help her pets feel seen and loved.",
  "On October 24, 2023, Audrey planned to order sushi for dinner that evening after seeing Andrew's sushi photo.",
  "Audrey said her dogs bring her much joy, and that seeing how they experience the world reminds her to appreciate life’s little pleasures.",
  "On 4 November 2023, Andrew said he already had two dogs named Toby and Buddy and was unsure about getting another dog because caring for two dogs was already a lot.",
  "As of November 22, 2023, Andrew was keeping Scout on a leash while Scout adjusted to being outside. Andrew and his girlfriend had obtained a bed, toys, and puppy pads to help make Scout comfortable and entertained.",
  "Audrey planned to learn about common birds in her area before birdwatching with Andrew. Andrew planned to bring binoculars and a notebook to log birds on the trip.",
  "Andrew has a dog named Toby. On August 24, 2023, Andrew said he hoped to build a stronger bond with Toby and shared photos of Toby, including a photo of a small dog sitting on the floor with a leash.",
  "On April 2, 2023, Audrey told Andrew that Audrey and her household had adopted a puppy named Pixie. Audrey described Pixie as very cute; a shared photo showed a small white dog sitting on a carpet.",
  "On Friday, November 17, 2023, Audrey took her dogs to a pet salon to be groomed. The dogs were excited, wagged their tails, eventually calmed down, and behaved well at the salon. Audrey shared a photo of a groomed dog with a shiny coat.",
  "On 18 August 2023, Andrew took a break from work and visited a new cafe; Andrew described the change as nice.",
  "Audrey and Andrew planned to go on a hike with their dogs in November 2023. Audrey said she would research and find a good hiking spot, and Andrew agreed to look for a place like the rural spot they had discussed.",
  "On June 13, 2023, Audrey shared photos of her two dogs running in a field with a ball and playing with a frisbee in a meadow.",
  "On 4 November 2023, Audrey said she kept her dogs mentally stimulated with puzzles, training, and hide-and-seek.",
  "On April 2, 2023, Andrew said Andrew wanted to find a dog-friendly place soon so Andrew could explore nature trails again with a dog. Audrey wished Andrew luck finding a dog-friendly place and a furry companion.",
  "Audrey takes Audrey’s dogs on road trips about once every couple of months so the dogs can explore and stay active.",
  "Audrey prioritizes her dogs' safety outdoors and has equipped the dogs with leashes and shoes.",
  "As of July 27, 2023, Audrey said her four fur babies were more important to her than anything. She described the oldest as relaxed, like a wise old sage; the second as always ready to play; the third as sometimes naughty but fond of cuddles; and the youngest as lively and adventurous. Audrey said she adored their individual personalities.",
  "Andrew shared a photo of a sunset over a mountain with a church on top, describing it as a photo from Andrew’s last hike.",
  "On 4 November 2023, Audrey said she had recently joined a dog owners group to learn how to take better care of her dogs.",
  "When Audrey was a child, Audrey and Max took long walks around the neighborhood, explored new paths, and grew close. Audrey shared her worries and hopes with Max, whom she remembered as a good listener who was always there for her. Audrey considered those walks among her favorite memories.",
  "On 6 September 2023, Audrey said she makes time for at least one self-care activity each day, such as treating herself to something nice.",
  "Audrey is busy caring for her pets and spending time with them, which Audrey finds fulfilling.",
  "Audrey said that on Friday, September 22, 2023, one of her dogs pulled so hard at a park that the leash broke. Audrey chased and caught the dog before the dog was hurt or ran off.",
  "Audrey is devoted to keeping her dogs healthy and happy, and she hopes they will return to normal and be able to go hiking.",
  "Andrew said on March 27, 2023, that he had no pets but loved animals.",
  "Audrey’s dogs love socializing with other dogs, getting exercise, playing fetch and frisbee, and running around the dog park. Audrey says the dogs could run for hours.",
  "On June 2, 2023, Audrey offered to help Andrew find a suitable place for a dog and asked Andrew to email Audrey his criteria.",
  "On 4 August 2023, Andrew hoped to build a deep bond with Toby and thought Toby could be a good hiking companion; Andrew planned to take Toby on a small hike at a local trail that day.",
  "As of July 3, 2023, Audrey was taking a challenging but rewarding dog-training course, and Audrey said the course was helping Audrey’s dogs do better.",
  "Audrey believes pets should learn to behave through positive reinforcement and that punishment is not the proper way to train pets. Audrey said she does not want to hurt any of her dogs.",
  "Andrew enjoys going for walks with Buddy, and Buddy likes exploring new hiking trails with Andrew and others.",
  "On July 27, 2023, Andrew said volunteering with animals was his way of giving back and making the animals' lives better.",
  "Andrew and Audrey discussed visiting another trail on a later trip to see the autumn colors and take photos with their dogs.",
  "During the week of April 9–15, 2023, Audrey made some of Audrey’s favorite treats and shared a photo of blueberry muffins in a muffin pan. Audrey suggested having a pastry party with Andrew, and Andrew agreed. Audrey said her dogs would come along; the party was discussed as a future plan, with no date or location specified.",
  "On May 6, 2023, Andrew was looking to adopt a dog. Andrew had been browsing websites, visiting shelters, and asking friends for help finding a dog.",
  "Andrew said he had been taking care of flowers on his balcony.",
  "Andrew recalled that Toby once got excited and chased a squirrel around a tree while the squirrel watched from the branches; Andrew found the incident hilarious."
 ],
